  "description": "The Green Lantern Caf\u00e9, known locally as \u201cGreen Lantern,\u201d is located at 123\u202fOak\u202fStreet in Springfield, IL (coordinates\u202f39.7817\u202fN,\u202f\u201189.6501\u202fW). You can reach the caf\u00e9 by calling (555)\u202f123\u20114567. Our menu is priced for everyday comfort, with dishes ranging from $5 up to $25.\n\nFor breakfast we recommend the Avocado Toast, a $8.50 offering that\u2019s both vegetarian and perfect for a morning start. If you\u2019re after a hearty lunch, the Chicken Caesar Salad is available for $12.00 and provides a satisfying blend of salad greens and protein. To finish on a sweet note, the Chocolate Lava Cake costs $7.50 and satisfies any dessert craving."
